.TH GALAPIX 1 "2026-09-16" "galapix" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
galapix \- zoomable image collection viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B galapix
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
[\fIFILE\fR|\fIURL\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B galapix
displays large image collections and high-resolution images in an
interactive zoomable OpenGL workspace. Non-option arguments are image
files, directories (scanned for images), or URLs.
.PP
With no files and no
.BR \-p
patterns, the frontend may open an empty workspace.
.PP
Thumbnail generation and durable multi-resolution tiles belong to
.BR thumtoo (1)
(e.g.
.BR thumtoo-prepare ).
When built with
.BR HAVE_THUMTOO ,
local files and archive members use the thumtoo tile backend (256\(mu256
JPEG pyramid). Pre-warm tiles with:
.PP
.nf
thumtoo-prepare --tiles \fIpaths\fR...
.fi
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-fullscreen
Start in fullscreen mode.
.TP
.BI \-g ", " \-\-geometry " WxH"
Initial window size (default: 1024x768).
.TP
.BI \-a ", " \-\-anti\-aliasing " N"
Anti-aliasing factor 0, 2, or 4 (default: 0).
.TP
.BI \-t ", " \-\-threads " N"
Worker threads (default: 2).
.TP
.BI \-F ", " \-\-files\-from " FILE"
Read additional paths/URLs from
.IR FILE
(one per line).
.TP
.BI \-p ", " \-\-pattern " PATTERN"
Select images already registered in the thumtoo cache (SQL LIKE;
.B *
/
.B ?
or
.B %
/
.BR _ ;
path prefix forms supported).
.TP
.BI \-\-thumtoo\-cache " DIR"
thumtoo cache root (default:
.I $XDG_CACHE_HOME/thumtoo
or
.IR ~/.cache/thumtoo ).
.TP
.B \-\-thumtoo
Accepted for compatibility; thumtoo tiles are used whenever the binary was
built with
.BR HAVE_THUMTOO .
.TP
.B \-\-no\-thumtoo
Not supported in
.B HAVE_THUMTOO
builds (legacy Galapix SQLite tiles removed). Use a build without
.B WITH_THUMTOO
for the historical path.
.TP
.BI \-d ", " \-\-database " FILE"
Deprecated no-op (resource DB removed; thumtoo owns the durable cache).
.SH CONTROLS
Interactive tools and key bindings are shown in the in-app help overlay
(when enabled).
.B F11
toggles fullscreen.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CACHE_HOME/thumtoo
Default thumtoo Store cache (tiles, locators, LQIP).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR thumtoo-prepare (1),
.BR thumtoo-status (1),
.BR thumtoo-tile (1)
.PP
Project documentation:
.IR docs/THUMTOO.md
in the source tree.
.SH AUTHOR
Ingo Ruhnke and contributors.
